  "term": "power base",
  "definition": "A power base is the main source from which a person’s influence in a relationship or process comes. In this consulting context, it refers to whether influence mainly comes from factors such as knowledge or identity, with knowledge described as the most dominant source affecting the consulting relationship and its outcomes.",
